Zindaan Andhera Hai Baba-- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
kyun Chod Gaye Tanha Baba -- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
<br>
1. Hai Ghor Andhera Sa Chaaya.<br>
aankho'n Se Nahi Kuch Bhi Dikhta.<br>
zindaan Hai Ye Kaisa Baba-- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Maqtal Mein Pukari Mai Baba.<br>
ek Laashe Besar Ne Di Sada.<br>
aaja Hai Idhar Tera Baba-- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Mai Aapki Itni Chaheeti Thi.<br>
seene Pe Aapke Sote Thi.<br>
ab Qaak Pe Hai Sona Baba-- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Ab Shumre Layeen L.a. Darata Hai.<br>
rone Pe Tamache Maarta Hai.<br>
dushwaar Hai Ab Jeena Baba-- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Kaano'n Se Lahoo Behta Hai Mere.<br>
aur Gaal Bhi Hai Mere Soojhe.<br>
kurta Hai Phata Mera Baba-- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Beemar Mera Bhaiya Abid Asws.<br>
zanjeer Me Hai Jakda Abid Asws.<br>
dhate Hai Sitam Aada Baba-- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Che Maah Ka Wo Mera Bhaiya.<br>
jhoole Se Jo Gir Kar Ran Ko Gaya.<br>
wo Bhi To Gaya Maara Baba-- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
<br>
8. Hote Jo Mere Abbas Asws. Chacha.<br>
hoti Na Ye Mujhpar Joro Jafa.<br>
kab Tak Yeh Sitam Sehna Baba-- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
<br>
9. Sunkar Ye Nauha (ali Haq) Ka.<br>
dete Hai Sada Sab Ahle Aza.<br>
matam Ye Sada Hoga Barpa-- Dam Ghut-ta Hai Mera Baba.<br>
<br>
<br>
az: Shayer E Ahlebait Janab Ali Haq Sahab.